  price_noSubsTitle: "Ditch the Subscriptions",
  price_noSubsDesc: "Subscription fatigue is real. Why should you pay a monthly fee to compress a single video or convert an audio file twice a year? We believe utility software should be free and accessible whenever you need it, without forcing you to remember to cancel a trial.",
